Invariant: community-services-location-requires-ptres-or-of
Description: "When serviceCategory is 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9, 10, 16, 17, 18 or 19, the appointment is not partOf another appointment, and virtualService is not present, contained Location must include PTRES or OF."
* severity = #error
* expression = "serviceCategory.coding.where(code in ('3' | '4' | '5' | '6' | '7' | '8' | '9' | '10' | '16' | '17' | '18' | '19')).empty() or partOf.exists() or extension('http://helsenorge.no/fhir/StructureDefinition/hn-basis-virtual-service').exists() or contained.ofType(Location).where(type.coding.where(system = 'http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-RoleCode' and (code = 'PTRES' or code = 'OF')).exists()).exists()"